title: Portal
---
<<declare $foundTeleporterEnergy = false>>
<<declare $portalInteracted = false>>
<<if $foundTeleporterEnergy>>
    System: The mysterious portal begins to glow brightly.
    System: The Teleporter Energy resonates with the portal.
    {$playerName}: Looks like this is what I needed to activate it.
    System: The portal has been activated!
    {$playerName}: Finally, a way out of here.
    System: Teleporting Soon...
<<elseif $portalInteracted == false>>
    System: A mysterious portal stands before you.
    System: Strange energy flows through it, almost as though it's connected to somewhere else.
    {$playerName}: Could this be a way out of here?
    System: The portal appears to be missing an energy source.
    {$playerName}: Maybe I should look around for something that can power it.
    <<set $portalInteracted = true>>
<<else>>
    System: The mysterious portal continues to glow faintly.
    {$playerName}: I still need to find the Teleporter Energy to activate this.
    System: Perhaps I should explore the surrounding area.

<<endif>>
===
